Filey changes to DesignCraft's web app (Office work > Designs): the control bridge
(apps/designcraft-web: designcraftControl/designcraftOpen) that lets the Filey agent drive it with
DesignCraft's own control protocol, and the app named "Designs" where users see it.
Upstream: https://github.com/storytold/designcraft commit 5aeb4dd743067e5a6d797d0f613448a06d141a09 (main). MIT OR Apache-2.0.

Build: git apply filey-control.patch; cd apps/designcraft-web; trunk build --release (CARGO_BUILD_JOBS=2 on 8 GB machines)
Install: node scripts/fetch-office-apps.mjs --app designcraft --from <designcraft>/dist/web (copy LICENSE-MIT/APACHE in first)

